  <Docs>
    <summary>A base class for tag technologies that are built on top of transceive().</summary>
    <remarks>
      <para>The connection and tag properties are implemented in the <format type="text/html"><a href="https://android.googlesource.com/platform/packages/modules/Nfc/+/refs/tags/android-16.0.0_r1/framework/java/android/nfc/tech/BasicTagTechnology.java">Android 16 base implementation</a></format>. Connection and cancellation requirements are defined by the <format type="text/html"><a href="https://android.googlesource.com/platform/packages/modules/Nfc/+/refs/tags/android-16.0.0_r1/framework/java/android/nfc/tech/TagTechnology.java">Android 16 tag technology contract</a></format>.</para>
      <para>A base class for tag technologies that are built on top of transceive().</para>
      <para>
        <format type="text/html">
          <a href="https://developer.android.com/reference/android/nfc/tech/BasicTagTechnology" title="Reference documentation">Java documentation for <code>android.nfc.tech.BasicTagTechnology</code>.</a>
        </format>
      </para>
