      <Docs>
        <summary>Gets whether this technology is connected and the tag is still present.</summary>
        <value><see langword="true" /> if this technology is connected and the NFC service reports that the tag is present; otherwise, <see langword="false" />.</value>
        <remarks>
          <para>A successful connection and a present tag are required for a <see langword="true" /> result. If the NFC service cannot be contacted, the result is <see langword="false" />. This check does not guarantee that the tag will remain available for the next I/O operation.</para>
